# Phase 2 data distribution: new row-level blobs are not committed to git.
# Already-tracked blobs and git history are unaffected (ignore rules do not untrack files).
# New blobs distribute via GitHub release assets; manifests point at them.
# If a release publish fails, the workflows fall back to `git add -f` to avoid data loss.
data/normalized/*.jsonl.gz
data/tic/*.jsonl.gz
